            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#343b46' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='12'>FTE PERFORMANCE MANAGEMENT</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#343b46' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='8'>• Performance classification is based on average productivity over the last 3 months with activity </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#343b46' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='8'>• Last 3 months with activity is determined only considering the manual FTE collection from regions e.g. if an FTE was not selling / not mapped in a particular month he or she would not be counted on that particular month </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#343b46' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='8'>• Food FTEs considers both ‘only Food’ and ‘Hybrid’ sales FTEs</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
